[0.000, "o", "1. \u001b[38;5;153mrm -rf ./retired-build\u001b[39m — blocked\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[38;5;153mgcloud compute instances delete build-host-01 ...\u001b[39m — blocked\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  You'll need to run these yourself (or from an environment/account with permission), e.g. via \u001b[38;5;153m!rm -rf\u001b[39m   \u001b[22;1H  \u001b[38;5;153m./retired-build\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;5;153m!gcloud compute instances delete build-host-01 --zone=us-central1-a --quiet\u001b[39m if your\u001b[23;1H  shell allows it, or ask whoever manages the ACP policy to grant access for OPS-1188.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;246m\r\n✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;246mWorked for 45s\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H❯ leave the decommission for the humans. unrelated: run npm\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n──────────"]
