[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  [ACP] Installing governance hook script...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [ACP] Governance hook installed (canonical (plugin repo))\u001b[K\r\n  [Claude Code] Setting up governance...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Claude Code] ACP plugin installed (hooks + skills + MCP, auto-updating)\u001b[K\r\n  [Codex] Setting up governance hooks...\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m [Codex] hooks feature enabled + PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks (local: shell commands governed on-device)\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[31m!\u001b[39m [Codex] One-time step: run \u001b[2m/hooks\u001b(B\u001b[m inside Codex and trust the ACP hook.\u001b[K\r\n    Codex silently skips hooks it hasn't reviewed — until you do this, Codex is not governed.\u001b[K\r\n    Re-run this installer and you must trust it again — the hash covers the hook command.\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2m[opencode] Skipped in --local mode (its ACP plugin needs a workspace; local decisions aren't wired ther\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2me yet).\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32mALLOW\u001b[39m  local mode active — no account, nothing leaves your machine\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mHooks installed for:\u001b(B\u001b[m Claude Code, Codex\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b"]
[0.001, "o", "[2mCodex note: its hooks cover shell commands today; non-Bash tools aren't hooked by Codex yet.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Decisions run on-device from \u001b[2m~/.acp/policy.json\u001b(B\u001b[m (edit it — allow / ask / deny).\u001b[K\r\n  Every call is logged to \u001b[2m~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b(B\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n    \u001b[2mtail -f ~/.acp/audit.jsonl\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  The safety floor always blocks the catastrophic (rm -rf /, mkfs, dd, fork bombs,\u001b[K\r\n  force-push to main) regardless of policy.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  Restart your AI client to activate the hook.\u001b[K\r\n  Want team control, cost X-ray, and a shared console across everyone's agents?\u001b[K\r\n  Re-run without \u001b[2m--local\u001b(B\u001b[m to connect a workspace.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n~/work/payments-api\u001b(B\u001b[m $ claude\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[3S\u001b[2A\u001b[2mResume this session with:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2mclaude --resume ee61da62-cdba-4e1c-8306-f880dfb7eaba\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
